                                                "example_id": "5cfc1228-ac1f-4df5-b5db-e5aca5958a32",
                                                "sense_id": "f198c3c8-cf98-3e45-af57-60e09a170109",
                                                "text": "[…]; and the modern Shintoist concludes that the primæval Japanese were pure and holy from the fact that they are represented as a people who had no moral commandments."
